# Prisma migrations MUST be version-controlled (schema DDL only — no secrets/data).
# They would otherwise be caught by the global *.sql rule above.
!apps/backend/prisma/migrations/
!apps/backend/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql

# Sealed hidden-vulnerability answer key — keep local, never baked into images.
